      ],
      "importance": 5,
      "verified": true,
      "full": {
        "turns": [
          {
            "id": "L-S2E02-C01-T01",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hopeless Landon"
            },
            "text": "Hey."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E02-C01-T02",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Hey."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E02-C01-T03",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hopeless Landon"
            },
            "text": "We saw each other earlier, right?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E02-C01-T04",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Yeah. Uh... I was just out on a walk to clear my head."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E02-C01-T05",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hopeless Landon"
            },
            "text": "Rough night?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E02-C01-T06",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Uh, yeah, actually, uh... Relationship trouble."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E02-C01-T07",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hopeless Landon"
            },
            "text": "Must be contagious."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E02-C01-T08",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Why? You, too?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E02-C01-T09",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hopeless Landon"
            },
            "text": "Yeah. I'm with this really amazing girl, but all of a sudden, everything's super complicated."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E02-C01-T10",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Huh."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E02-C01-T11",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hopeless Landon"
            },
            "text": "You?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E02-C01-T12",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Oh, uh... Uh, old story, I guess, uh... Fell for a guy who doesn't even know that I exist."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E02-C01-T13",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hopeless Landon"
            },
            "text": "Huh. Classic."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E02-C01-T14",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Yeah."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E02-C01-T15",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hopeless Landon"
            },
            "text": "She is really great, but I just feel like I want it to be perfect, and..."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E02-C01-T16",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Yeah."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E02-C01-T17",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hopeless Landon"
            },
            "text": "And I want to be the perfect boyfriend, and she's trying to be the perfect girlfriend, and it was really effortless, but now it feels so off. I don't know. Sorry."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E02-C01-T18",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "No, uh... You know, um, a very smart boy once taught me that sometimes you have to be brave enough to be imperfect with people even if it's scary."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E02-C01-T19",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hopeless Landon"
            },
            "text": "Yeah. Of course, you're gonna have to take your own advice and tell that boy of yours that you exist."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E02-C01-T20",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "action": "tear falls"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E02-C01-T21",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Oh. I don't know about that."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E02-C01-T22",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hopeless Landon"
            },
            "text": "I hope your night gets better."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E02-C01-T23",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Thanks."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E02-C01-T24",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hopeless Landon"
            },
            "text": "This'll help. Peanut butter blast, whipped cream on the bottom. It's probably all melted by now, but, um..."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E02-C01-T25",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Oh."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E02-C01-T26",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hopeless Landon"
            },
            "text": "I don't even know why I ordered it. I didn't have any of it. I didn't want a milkshake. It just seemed..."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E02-C01-T27",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hopeless Landon"
            },
            "text": "Thanks for listening."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E02-C01-T28",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "action": "sobbing"
          }
        ]
      },
